---
const article = '/posts/nvidia-500-milliards-qui-n-existent-pas-encore/';
---

<section class="follow-up" id="suivi-nvidia" aria-labelledby="follow-up-title">
  <div class="follow-up-top">
    <p class="mono-label">// une analyse, la suite</p>
    <span>Suivi du <time datetime="2026-09-08">8 septembre 2026</time></span>
  </div>
  <h2 id="follow-up-title">Nvidia : qui paie si OpenAI ne paie plus ?</h2>
  <ol class="follow-up-timeline">
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-08-11">11 août</time>
      <p>Quels risques Nvidia accepte-t-il de garantir ?</p>
      <a href={`${article}#analyse-initiale`}>L’analyse initiale <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-08-17">17 août</time>
      <p>Jusqu’à <b>105 Md$</b> de garanties pour un campus de SB Energy loué à OpenAI.</p>
      <a href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000069/nvda-20260817.htm">Le dépôt SEC <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2026-08-26">26 août</time>
      <p>Un modèle de garantie devient public. Des paramètres restent masqués.</p>
      <a href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000075/nvda2027q2ex101.htm">Le document <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="follow-up-bottom">
    <p><strong>105 Md$ est un plafond conditionnel, pas une perte estimée.</strong></p>
    <a class="follow-up-cta" href={`${article}#suivi-septembre-2026`}>Lire le suivi et ses preuves <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .follow-up { margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.8rem); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-top: 3px solid var(--color-signal); border-radius: 3px 3px 14px 14px; background: var(--surface-elevated); scroll-margin-top: 2rem; }
  .follow-up-top { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: .6rem 1rem; }
  .follow-up-top .mono-label { color: var(--color-signal); }
  .follow-up-top > span { color: var(--color-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .65rem; }
  h2 { max-width: 28ch; margin-top: .9rem; color: var(--color-bright); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.8rem); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .follow-up-timeline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.2rem; margin: 1.3rem 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .follow-up-timeline li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); padding-top: .7rem; }
  .follow-up-timeline time { color: var(--color-signal); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .7rem; }
  .follow-up-timeline p { margin: .4rem 0 .55rem; color: var(--color-prose); font-family: var(--font-read); font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .follow-up-timeline a { margin-top: auto; align-self: start; padding: .25rem 0; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--color-signal); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .follow-up-bottom { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-line); }
  .follow-up-bottom p { flex: 1 1 20rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-family: var(--font-read); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .follow-up-bottom strong { font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-prose); }
  .follow-up-cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: .75rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-signal); border-radius: 5px; color: var(--color-signal); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 600; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-signal); outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .follow-up-timeline { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
    .follow-up-timeline li { border-top: 0; border-left: 2px solid var(--color-line); padding: 0 0 0 1rem; }
    .follow-up-timeline p { font-size: .95rem; }
    .follow-up-timeline a { min-height: 2.75rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
    .follow-up-cta { width: 100%; }
  }
